    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 24,
    "summary": "David testifies, The earth is the Lord’s and the fulness thereof, he who has clean hands and a pure heart will ascend unto the hill of the Lord, and the Lord of Hosts is the King of Glory.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "The earth is the Lord’s, and the fulness thereof; the world, and they that dwell therein.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 9,
            "text": "Ex. 9:29; Deut. 10:14; Ps. 89:11; 1 Cor. 10:26. TG Nature, Earth."
          },
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 23,
            "text": "1 Chr. 29:14."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 12
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For he hath founded it upon the seas, and established it upon the floods.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Who shall ascend into the hill of the Lord? or who shall stand in his holy place?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "Ps. 15:1 (1–5); 1 Ne. 15:33 (33–36); Mosiah 15:23 (19–26); D&C 76:62 (50–70); Moses 6:57 (55–59)."
          },
          {
            "start": 70,
            "end": 80,
            "text": "TG Holiness; Temple."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "He that hath clean hands, and a pure heart; who hath not lifted up his soul unto vanity, nor sworn deceitfully.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "TG Chastity; Cleanliness."
          },
          {
            "start": 19,
            "end": 24,
            "text": "1 Tim. 2:8."
          },
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 36,
            "text": "TG Purity; Virtue."
          },
          {
            "start": 37,
            "end": 42,
            "text": "TG Heart."
          },
          {
            "start": 81,
            "end": 87,
            "text": "TG Vanity."
          },
          {
            "start": 93,
            "end": 98,
            "text": "TG Swearing."
          },
          {
            "start": 99,
            "end": 110,
            "text": "TG Deceit; Honesty."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "He shall receive the blessing from the Lord, and righteousness from the God of his salvation.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "This is the generation of them that seek him, that seek thy face, O Jacob. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 66,
            "end": 73,
            "text": "OR even Jacob."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 7
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Lift up your heads, O ye gates; and be ye lift up, ye everlasting doors; and the King of glory shall come in.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4,
            "text": "JST Ps. 24:7–10 (Appendix)."
          },
          {
            "start": 101,
            "end": 105,
            "text": "TG Jesus Christ, Second Coming."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Who is this King of glory? The Lord strong and mighty, the Lord mighty in battle.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "TG Kingdom of God, in Heaven."
          },
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 25,
            "text": "Alma 5:50."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 6
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Lift up your heads, O ye gates; even lift them up, ye everlasting doors; and the King of glory shall come in.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 46
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Who is this King of glory? The Lord of hosts, he is the King of glory. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "TG Jesus Christ, Prophecies about."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 51
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
